<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">

<head>

<meta charset="UTF-8">

<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>PYR Project Card</title>

<style>

*{
    margin:0;
    padding:0;
    box-sizing:border-box;
}

body{

    background:transparent;

    display:flex;

    justify-content:center;

    align-items:center;

    min-height:100vh;

    font-family:Arial,sans-serif;

}

.game-box{

    width:250px;
    height:500px;

    background:#fff;

    border-radius:15px;

    overflow:hidden;

    position:relative;

    box-shadow:0 0 20px rgba(130,80,255,.18);

    transition:.45s ease;

}

.game-box:hover{

    transform:translateY(-8px);

    box-shadow:
        0 0 30px rgba(140,90,255,.55),
        0 0 60px rgba(120,70,255,.25);

}



/* 이미지 */

.game-image{

    display:block;

    width:250px;

    height:250px;

    overflow:hidden;

    position:relative;

}

.game-image img{

    width:100%;

    height:100%;

    object-fit:cover;

    display:block;

    transition:.6s;

}

.game-image::after{

    content:"";

    position:absolute;

    inset:0;

    background:linear-gradient(
        135deg,
        rgba(140,90,255,.35),
        transparent
    );

    opacity:0;

    transition:.45s;

}

.game-box:hover .game-image::after{

    opacity:1;

}

.game-box:hover .game-image img{

    transform:scale(1.08);

}



/* 정보 */

.game-info{

    height:250px;

    padding:15px;

    background:linear-gradient(
        180deg,
        #ffffff,
        #f5f0ff
    );

    text-align:center;

}

.game-title{

    font-size:18px;

    font-weight:bold;

    color:#111;

    letter-spacing:1px;

}

.game-type{

    margin-top:6px;

    font-size:11px;

    color:#7d62d9;

}

.game-desc{

    margin-top:18px;

    font-size:11px;

    color:#444;

    line-height:1.7;

}



/* 화살표 */

.game-more{

    display:block;

    margin-top:18px;

    text-decoration:none;

    font-size:36px;

    color:#7656ff;

    opacity:.65;

    transition:.35s ease;

}

.game-more:hover{

    opacity:1;

    transform:translateX(10px) scale(1.12);

    text-shadow:
        0 0 10px #9a7bff,
        0 0 20px #9a7bff;

}

</style>

</head>

<body>

<div class="game-box">

<a class="game-image"

href="https://sites.google.com/view/irsc-official/games/pyr"

target="_top">

<img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/leegeeaaa-a11y/WEB/main/PYR.png">

</a>



<div class="game-info">

<div class="game-title">

파이리듬 [PYR]

</div>

<div class="game-type">

Rhythm Game

</div>

<div class="game-desc">

IRISCODE의 첫 프로젝트.

<br><br>

확장성을 중심으로 설계된
리듬 게임 프로젝트입니다.

<br><br>

다양한 콘텐츠와 모드를
자유롭게 확장할 수 있도록
개발되고 있습니다.

</div>

<a class="game-more"

href="https://sites.google.com/view/irsc-official/games/pyr"

target="_top">

›

</a>

</div>

</div>

</body>

</html>
